{"term": {"label": "智", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "4B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/li-lou-ii", "title": "離婁下", "description": "孟子曰：「舜生於諸馮，遷於負夏，卒於鳴條，東夷之人也。文王生於岐周，卒於畢郢，西夷之人也。地之相去也，千有餘里；世之相後也，千有餘歲。得志行乎中國，若合符節。先聖後聖，其揆一也。」\n子產聽鄭國之政，以其乘輿濟人於溱洧。孟子曰：「惠而不知為政。歲十一月徒杠成，十二月輿梁成，民未病涉也。君子平其政，行辟人可也。焉得人人而濟", "occurrences": 5, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "事", "id": "事"}, {"form": "取", "id": "取"}, {"form": "善", "id": "善"}, {"form": "大", "id": "大"}, {"form": "好", "id": "好"}, {"form": "惡", "id": "惡"}, {"form": "日", "id": "日"}, {"form": "智", "id": "智"}, {"form": "死", "id": "死"}, {"form": "水", "id": "水"}, {"form": "生", "id": "生"}, {"form": "當", "id": "當"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}, {"form": "言", "id": "言"}, {"form": "酒", "id": "酒"}], "edges": [{"weight": 0.6466271649250525, "source": "言", "target": "行"}, {"weight": 1.69644928942373, "source": "言", "target": "善"}, {"weight": 0.7519876805828787, "source": "言", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 1.8505999692509885, "source": "言", "target": "好"}, {"weight": 1.5629178967992075, "source": "言", "target": "惡"}, {"weight": 1.5629178967992075, "source": "言", "target": "酒"}, {"weight": 2.128231705849268, "source": "日", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 2.302585092994046, "source": "善", "target": "好"}, {"weight": 2.0149030205422647, "source": "善", "target": "惡"}, {"weight": 2.0149030205422647, "source": "善", "target": "酒"}, {"weight": 1.2039728043259361, "source": "善", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 2.2335922215070942, "source": "事", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 2.128231705849268, "source": "事", "target": "生"}, {"weight": 2.8213788864092133, "source": "事", "target": "當"}, {"weight": 3.044522437723423, "source": "事", "target": "死"}, {"weight": 2.6390573296152584, "source": "事", "target": "水"}, {"weight": 2.128231705849268, "source": "事", "target": "行"}, {"weight": 2.128231705849268, "source": "事", "target": "智"}, {"weight": 1.540445040947149, "source": "生", "target